  "caption": "The video captures a man-made whitewater channel where a person in a red life jacket and silver helmet floats beside a yellow-framed structure topped by a flat white pad. A paddle blade protrudes at the upper-left, blue blocks sit in the foreground, and a sponsor banner lines the bank as they drift.\n\nA cross-dissolve blends the close view into a wider shot of the same venue. A metal footbridge crowded with spectators and staff spans the channel, while a large video screen at the upper right shows a raft on a ramp. An inclined launch ramp dips its end into the water beside a bank wall reading RAPIDS, where an orange inflatable raft with helmeted paddlers descends toward the channel.\n\nThe raft then leaves the ramp and moves out into the open water, its occupants working paddles as it travels. The framing gradually reveals more of the RAPIDS wall and the foreground blue blocks, and the clip ends with the raft still moving.",
